  "goodToKnow": "Die Zucht is breeding: die Pferdezucht, die Hundezucht, die Pflanzenzucht. It also means discipline, now old-fashioned: Zucht und Ordnung (law and order, strict discipline). Related: züchten (to breed, grow), der Züchter (breeder), die Erziehung (upbringing) from the same root ziehen. Das Zuchthaus was a penitentiary until 1969. The Trakehner horse breed comes from former East Prussia. Plural: die Zuchten."
